 image preview generation. Clicking \"Generate Preview Frame\" triggers a request to `/api/generate-image-preview`. I\'m crafting a terminal loading bar with phrases like \"Developing 35mm Film negative...\" to enhance the experience. Upon generation, the AI-generated image appears within a vintage TV/polaroid border. If it fails, a Retro CSS-styled fallback appears with scene details and a prompt for external use. I\'m also constructing a \"Concept Mixer & Sandbox\" control panel for scene modifications, such as adding rain or shifting lighting.\n\n\n"
