  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Communication Protocols**\n\nOkay, I\'ve just been reviewing the communication guidelines. I\'m focusing on crafting succinct summaries that meet the criteria. I\'m aiming for clarity and brevity. I\'m now ready to address the user as per the instructions!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and configured the **AI Nostalgia Video Generator**, a highly polished, full-stack video concept and prompt director workspace designed to curate viral first-person POV scenes that trigger emotional memories.\n\nThis application is ready to accept decades or custom themes, process them securely via a server-side route powered by the latest **Gemini 3.5 Flash** model, and spit out 5 culturally accurate storyboard scenes configured exactly to your specifications.\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Design Experience\n*   **Warm Twilight Interface**: Designed a high-contrast dark-mode console using slate grays and vintage amber highlights to pay homage to classic film boards and recording desks.\n*   **Aesthetic Typography**: Paired spacious Inter display headings with high-readability monospace styling for data-focused HUD indicators and terminal consoles.\n*   **CRT Signal Overlays**: Integrated elegant scanline overlays, blinking digital cursors, and custom loading bars to simulate the nostalgic cathode-ray tube aura of earlier decades.\n\n### \342\232\231\357\270\217 Functional Features\n*   **Dynamic Parameter Customizer**: Includes selection badging for Target Decades (1970s\342\200\2232010s), suggested theme presets (e.g., *Blockbuster Friday, Saturday Morning Cartoons, Silver Flip Phones*), target age demographics, and regional flavorings (US, UK, Australia, Europe).\n*   **Strict POV Prompt Formulas**: The backend constructs highly specialized, photorealistic first-person POV Image and Video prompts using the exact template structures requested, substituting historically accurate physical devices, lighting sources, background relics, and hand gestures.\n*   **Interactive Tweak Sandbox**: Each scene card includes a sandbox panel allowing you to adjust individual nostalgic parameters\342\200\224such as the target object, lighting, or hand motions\342\200\224and automatically rebuilds the final prompt formulas in real time.\n*   **35mm Film Image Drafts**: Allows creators to trigger a draft render using server-side image generation. It shows a simulated film development loader, and captures the visual frame directly inside the card using Gemini image rendering capabilities.\n*   **One-Click Social Creator Bundles**: Features immediate copy actions for the Image Prompt, Video Prompt, and a fully structured **Creator Bundle script** that populates a ready-to-post visual strategy complete with recommend sound overlays and trending hashtags.\n*   **Saved Workspace Drawer**: Integrates client-side persistence through browser `localStorage`, allowing video creators to save, categorize, and export their favorite storyboard rolls dynamically across browser sessions.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 374409268
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
