    user_response: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#0a0a0a] text-neutral-300 font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between px-8 bg-[#0f0f0f]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-black font-black italic\\\">N</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"font-serif text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-white uppercase\\\">Nostalgia Engine <span class=\\\"text-amber-500 font-sans text-xs align-top tracking-normal ml-2 opacity-70\\\">PROMPT GENERATOR v2.4</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-amber-500 cursor-pointer\\\">Generator</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Archive</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Demographics</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Settings</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#0d0d0d] p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-3 block\\\">Generation Parameters</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-neutral-400 block mb-2\\\">Target Decade</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">1980s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-amber-500/20 rounded border border-amber-500/50 text-xs text-amber-500\\\">1990s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">2000s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">2010s</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-neutral-400 block mb-2\\\">Emotional Tone</span>\\n            <select class=\\\"w-full bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 rounded px-3 py-2 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-500/50\\\">\\n              <option>Wistful & Melancholy</option>\\n              <option>Cozy & Safe</option>\\n              <option>Rebellious Youth</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-3 block\\\">Active Sequence</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white/5 border-l-2 border-amber-500 rounded-r\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-white\\\">Scene 01: The CRT Saturday</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-1\\\">Active Concept</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-200\\\">Scene 02: Blockbuster Night</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-200\\\">Scene 03: The First Console</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-200\\\">Scene 04: Cereal Commercials</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <button class=\\\"w-full bg-amber-500 text-black py-3 rounded font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-4\\\">\\n        Regenerate Batch\\n      </button>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] p-10 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-8 border-b border-white/5 pb-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-amber-500 font-mono text-sm tracking-tighter\\\">SEQ_001</span>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-4xl font-serif italic text-white\\\">The Saturday Morning Ritual</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-neutral-500 text-sm italic\\\">POV: A crisp October morning in 1994. The world is small, warm, and static-charged.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 px-2 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-amber-500 z-10 font-bold\\\">Image Prompt Matrix</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-[#0f0f0f] border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-sm relative\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 font-light\\\">\\n              A raw, photorealistic first-person POV shot looking through the character\'s own eyes\342\200\224the scene is framed exactly as if the viewer is the character. Both forearms and wrists enter the frame from the bottom-left and bottom-right corners, gripping a <span class=\\\"text-amber-500\\\">transparent Atomic Purple Gameboy Color</span>. The room is dimly lit by the <span class=\\\"text-amber-500\\\">soft flicker of a bulky CRT TV</span> playing Saturday morning cartoons. The background features stacked CD jewel cases and a half-eaten bowl of Froot Loops. Shot on 35mm film with slight grain.\\n            </p>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex gap-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">35MM_GRAIN</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">FIRST_PERSON_POV</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">1990S_ACCURATE</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"relative group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 px-2 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-amber-500 z-10 font-bold\\\">Video Prompt Matrix</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-[#0f0f0f] border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-sm\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 font-light\\\">\\n              The camera gently sways with <span class=\\\"text-amber-500\\\">subtle breathing motion</span>, slightly unsteady as if sitting naturally. The hands remain mostly stationary with only small, repetitive gestures\342\200\224one thumb lightly pressing the D-pad rhythmically. The lighting from the <span class=\\\"text-amber-500\\\">flickering CRT light shifts</span> across the hands as the game screen changes from bright white to deep blue. No dramatic movements, just the quiet, immersive feeling of someone deeply absorbed in a nostalgic moment.\\n            </p>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex gap-2\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">BREATHING_FPS</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">MICRO_MOVEMENTS</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white/5 text-[9px] text-neutral-500 border border-white/5\\\">DYNAMIC_LIGHTING</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto pt-8 flex justify-between items-end border-t border-white/5\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Region Compatibility</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-neutral-300 font-medium\\\">USA, UK, CA, AU, DE, FR</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Target Demographic</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-neutral-300 font-medium\\\">Ages 25\342\200\22450+ (Millennial/GenX)</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-all font-bold\\\">Export Prompts</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white text-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\\\">Copy All Scenes</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#0a0a0a] text-neutral-300 font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between px-8 bg-[#0f0f0f]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-black font-black italic\\\">N</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"font-serif text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-white uppercase\\\">Nostalgia Engine <span class=\\\"text-amber-500 font-sans text-xs align-top tracking-normal ml-2 opacity-70\\\">PROMPT GENERATOR v2.4</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-amber-500 cursor-pointer\\\">Generator</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Archive</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Demographics</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\">Settings</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#0d0d0d] p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-3 block\\\">Generation Parameters</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-neutral-400 block mb-2\\\">Target Decade</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">1980s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-amber-500/20 rounded border border-amber-500/50 text-xs text-amber-500\\\">1990s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">2000s</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded border border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400\\\">2010s</button>\\n            </div>\\n    